TITLE Equilibrate pure water with fixed-pressure gas phase at 150C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7
    pe 4
    units kgw
    water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 150
    CH4(g) 0
    CO2(g) 0
    NH3(g) 0
REACTION 1
    CH4(g) 10
    CO2(g) 10
    NH3(g) 5
    1
END
